<title>SRI LANKA: Magpek trading suspended.</title>
<headline>Magpek trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Magpek Exports Ltd has been suspended until January 16, a statement from the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Trading has been suspended until shareholders receive a circular informing them the company's manufacturing operations will cease from January 17, a stock exchange release said.</p>
<p>Magpek Exports manufactures children's toys and wooden educational material for export.</p>
